<title>USA: North Bancshares completes stock buyback.</title>
<headline>North Bancshares completes stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Bancshares Inc said Tuesday it completed its sixth stock repurchase program, buying five percent or 55,681 of the company's outstanding shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The shares were repurchased at an average price of $16.08 per share. The company now has 1,057,950 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>North Bancshares is the holding company for North Federal Savings Bank.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
